fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstvalue.html#gst_value_hash","fragment":"\n\tgst_value_hash\n\n\n\tGst.prototype.value_hash\n\n\n\tGst.value_hash\n\nCompute a hash value of value.\nGValue considered as equals by gst_value_compare will have the same hash value.\nParameters:\na GValue to hash\na location to store the hash value\nTRUE, or FALSE if value cannot be hashed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCompute a hash value of value.\nGObject.Value considered as equals by Gst.prototype.value_compare will have the same hash value.\nParameters:\na GObject.Value to hash\nReturns a tuple made of:\ntrue, or false if value cannot be hashed.\ntrue, or false if value cannot be hashed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCompute a hash value of value.\nGObject.Value considered as equals by Gst.value_compare will have the same hash value.\nParameters:\na GObject.Value to hash\nReturns a tuple made of:\nTrue, or False if value cannot be hashed.\nTrue, or False if value cannot be hashed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});